{"john_wiley_sons_ltd": "John Wiley & Sons Ltd is a globally recognized publishing company specializing in academic, educational, and professional content across various fields such as science, technology, medicine, and humanities. They publish a wide range of books, journals, and digital resources, including notable publications like the Transplant International journal.|Here is another description: John Wiley & Sons Ltd is a global publishing company that specializes in academic, educational, and professional content across various fields, including science, technology, and medicine.|Here is another description: John Wiley & Sons Ltd is a global publishing company that specializes in academic, educational, and professional content across a variety of subjects, including medical and scientific journals.|Here is another description: John Wiley & Sons Ltd is a global publishing company that specializes in academic, educational, and professional content across various fields, including scientific research.|Here is another description: John Wiley & Sons Ltd is a renowned global publishing company known for its extensive range of academic, professional, and educational content. It has a significant presence in various fields including science, technology, and medicine.|Here is another description: John Wiley & Sons Ltd is a global publishing company that publishes academic, professional, and general-interest books and journals, including Transplant International."},
{"398__has_doi__10_1111_tri_13818": "The predicate 'has doi' indicates that the subject is associated with a Digital Object Identifier (DOI), which is a unique alphanumeric string assigned to identify content and provide a persistent link to its location on the internet."},
