{"steunstichting_esot": "Steunstichting ESOT is an organization that supports the European Society for Organ Transplantation (ESOT) by facilitating the publication and dissemination of transplant-related research and information, particularly through its association with the journal \"Transplant International.\"|Here is another description: Steunstichting ESOT is an organization associated with the European Society for Organ Transplantation, involved in the publication of academic and professional content related to organ transplantation.|Here is another description: Steunstichting ESOT is an organization associated with the European Society for Organ Transplantation (ESOT), involved in the publication and dissemination of transplant-related research and information.|Here is another description: Steunstichting ESOT is an organization involved in the field of transplantation, as indicated by its association with the publication in Transplant International."},
