{"10_intra_or_postoperative_variables": "The object consists of 10 intra or postoperative variables that were among the 16 baseline predictors included in the ANN-based model. These variables are crucial for predicting long-term outcomes after liver transplantation, as identified by Khosravi et al. in their study."},
