{"proofs_of_concept": "Proofs of concept in this context refer to preliminary demonstrations or initial evidence that the machine learning models have potential, though they require further exploration and confirmation through additional research."},
{"preliminary_results": "The preliminary results refer to the initial findings from various studies mentioned in the context, particularly those related to the application of machine learning models in predicting post-transplant complications."},
