{"transplant_international__copyright__\u00aa_2021_steunstichting_esot": "The copyright predicate signifies the legal ownership and protection of the content published in Transplant International. It ensures that the material is protected under intellectual property laws, allowing the rightful owner to control its use and distribution.|Here is another description: The copyright predicate signifies the legal ownership and protection of the content published in Transplant International. It ensures that the material is protected from unauthorized use and reproduction.|Here is another description: The copyright predicate signifies the legal ownership and protection of the content published in Transplant International. It ensures that the material is protected under intellectual property laws, allowing the rightful owner to control its use and distribution."},
{"\u00aa_2021_steunstichting_esot": "\u00aa 2021 Steunstichting ESOT represents the copyright holder of the content published in the 2021 issue of Transplant International. Steunstichting ESOT is an organization that supports the European Society for Organ Transplantation, indicating their role in managing and protecting the intellectual property associated with the publication.|Here is another description: \u00aa 2021 Steunstichting ESOT represents the copyright holder of the content published in the 2021 issue of Transplant International. Steunstichting ESOT is an organization that supports the European Society for Organ Transplantation (ESOT), indicating their role in managing the publication's intellectual property rights.|Here is another description: \u00aa 2021 Steunstichting ESOT represents the copyright holder of the content published in Transplant International for the year 2021. Steunstichting ESOT is an organization that supports the European Society for Organ Transplantation, indicating their role in managing and protecting the intellectual property associated with the publication."},
{"transplant_international__published_by__john_wiley_sons_ltd": "The predicate 'published by' indicates the entity responsible for the production, distribution, and overall management of the journal. This includes overseeing the editorial process, ensuring the quality of the content, and making the journal accessible to readers.|Here is another description: The predicate \"published_by\" indicates the entity responsible for the production, distribution, and often the editorial oversight of a publication. In this context, it signifies that John Wiley & Sons Ltd is the publisher of the journal Transplant International.|Here is another description: The predicate \"published by\" indicates the entity responsible for the production, distribution, and often the editorial oversight of the journal. This relationship is crucial as it establishes the credibility and authority of the publication.|Here is another description: The predicate 'published by' indicates the entity responsible for the production, distribution, and often the editorial oversight of the journal, ensuring its content meets academic standards and reaches the intended audience."},
