{"0_835_0_831_0_840": "The object \"0.835 [0.831\u20130.840]\" represents the ANN AUC value, which quantifies the accuracy of the ANN model in predicting graft failure at 1 month post-transplant. The value is accompanied by a 95% confidence interval, indicating the range within which the true AUC is likely to fall."},
